{"id":"W93c431f7de56c973ff0b9c92","zh":"运营状态","en":"","name":"运营状态","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C20a250d00d217006057c","families":[],"definition_zh":"线路或结构在投入运营条件下所表现的性能与状况。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W93c431f7de56c973ff0b9c92","text":"运营状态","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S6614ce34349b4d3cf40a","source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"基于此研究背景,课题组对滨洲线的运营状态和养护维修现状进行了现场调研、测试及分析,现详述之。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sdbfdbe55c9e970aedaa3","source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"钢轨运营状态及变化规律滨洲线地处严寒地区,地质、气候环境复杂,建设期早,小半径曲线多,运量大,现场调研情况表明,其钢轨磨耗和伤损情况有其自身特点,常见的病害有磨耗、轨头龟裂、压溃、剥离、接触疲劳、擦伤、焊缝伤损、肥边、接头高低差和大轨缝等。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P104":{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W57f4f4699377e93c83fb1dd0","name":"service state","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W57f4f4699377e93c83fb1dd0","name":"service state","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W57f4f4699377e93c83fb1dd0","name":"service state","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19